WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Take a right-angled triangle with sides three and four.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.980
Build a square on each side.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.760
Three squared is nine. Four squared is sixteen.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.400
Together, twenty-five: exactly the square on the longest side.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.700
So the longest side is five.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.200
a squared plus b squared equals c squared.

